obility (digest 3/10/2025). #PD-4402 is Quillfeather.\n\nThe 8/3 digest, the 5/3 handoff digest and the cheat sheet mention Vantorre Group issues (Hartford door assignments, duplicate check-ins at door 14) but give no ticket number. The 7/7/2025 and 12/1/2025 digests have none either.\n\nThis covers only those three sources. It isn't the full ticket history from the support system, which I can't see from here.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
